    "Demonstrates complex, cohesive pilot interaction by explicitly restating critical clearances (Runway 19 Right) before adding tactical emergency requests.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeigt einen zusammenhängenden Pilotenbeitrag: Die wichtige Freigabe Runway 19 Right wird vor weiteren Notfallanfragen wiederholt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muestra una intervención compleja y cohesionada al repetir la autorización clave Runway 19 Right antes de añadir peticiones de emergencia."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Montre un échange complexe et cohérent en reformulant l’autorisation essentielle Runway 19 Right avant d’ajouter les demandes d’urgence."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mostra un intervento complesso e coeso ripetendo l’autorizzazione essenziale Runway 19 Right prima di aggiungere richieste di emergenza."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重要な許可内容であるRunway 19 Rightを復唱してから緊急時の要求を加えることで、複雑な発言を一貫してつなぐ例です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "중요한 허가 내용인 Runway 19 Right를 다시 확인한 뒤 긴급 요청을 추가하여, 복잡한 조종사 발화를 일관되게 연결하는 예시입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toont een samenhangende pilotenreactie door eerst de belangrijke klaring Runway 19 Right te herhalen en daarna noodverzoeken toe te voegen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demonstra uma fala complexa e coesa ao repetir a autorização importante Runway 19 Right antes de acrescentar pedidos de emergência."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Показывает связную сложную реплику пилота: сначала повторяется важное разрешение Runway 19 Right, затем добавляются экстренные запросы."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先重述关键许可Runway 19 Right，再补充紧急请求，示范复杂而连贯的飞行员表达。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Describing response conditions precisely ('mobilized at the field') keeps the crew informed of emergency medical staging, reinforcing cockpit-cabin coordination.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Beschreibung mobilized at the field informiert die Besatzung über medizinische Vorbereitungen und unterstützt die Koordination zwischen Cockpit und Kabine."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describir la respuesta con mobilized at the field informa a la tripulación del despliegue médico y refuerza la coordinación entre cabina y pasaje."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La description mobilized at the field informe l’équipage des préparatifs médicaux et renforce la coordination cockpit-cabine."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Descrivere lo stato con mobilized at the field informa l’equipaggio sui preparativi medici e rafforza il coordinamento tra cockpit e cabina."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mobilized at the fieldのように対応状況を明確に示し、乗員が救急医療の準備状況を把握して操縦室と客室の連携を保つための情報を伝えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mobilized at the field처럼 대응 상태를 구체적으로 설명하면 승무원이 응급 의료 대응 준비 상황을 파악하고 조종실과 객실 간 협조를 유지하는 데 도움이 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De beschrijving mobilized at the field informeert de bemanning over de medische voorbereidingen en ondersteunt de coördinatie tussen cockpit en cabine."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Descrever a resposta com mobilized at the field informa a tripulação sobre o preparo médico e reforça a coordenação entre cockpit e cabine."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Фраза mobilized at the field информирует экипаж о подготовке медицинской помощи и поддерживает взаимодействие кабины пилотов с салоном."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用mobilized at the field等明确措辞描述救援状态，帮助机组了解医疗准备情况并维持驾驶舱与客舱协调。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detailing structural states ('retracted within the well', 'down and locked') helps the crew calculate landing attitudes and touchdown impact stresses accurately.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beschreibt Zustände mit retracted within the well und down and locked als Information zur Beurteilung von Landehaltung und Aufsetzbelastung."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detalla estados como retracted within the well y down and locked para informar la evaluación de la actitud de aterrizaje y los esfuerzos al tocar tierra."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Précise les états retracted within the well et down and locked pour éclairer l’évaluation de l’assiette et des contraintes au toucher."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Specifica stati come retracted within the well e down and locked per informare la valutazione dell’assetto e degli sforzi al contatto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "retracted within the wellとdown and lockedで脚の状態を具体的に示し、着陸姿勢や接地衝撃の評価に情報を提供します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "retracted within the well과 down and locked로 착륙장치 상태를 구체적으로 설명하여 승무원의 착륙 자세와 접지 충격 평가에 정보를 제공합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beschrijft de toestand met retracted within the well en down and locked voor de beoordeling van landingshouding en belasting bij het neerkomen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detalha estados como retracted within the well e down and locked para informar a avaliação da atitude de pouso e esforços no toque."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Уточняет состояние словами retracted within the well и down and locked для оценки посадочного положения и нагрузок при касании."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用retracted within the well和down and locked准确说明起落架结构状态，为机组评估着陆姿态及接地冲击提供信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
