    "Explains the operational consequences of the failure ('degraded flight controls and braking') so that ATC can prioritize runway selection (LDA) and coordinate runway foaming.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erklärt die Folgen mit degraded flight controls and braking und liefert Informationen für die Pistenwahl anhand der LDA sowie die Koordination des Einschäumens."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Explica las consecuencias con degraded flight controls and braking, aportando información para seleccionar pista según la LDA y coordinar el espumado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Explique les conséquences avec degraded flight controls and braking, pour éclairer le choix de piste selon la LDA et la coordination du moussage."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spiega le conseguenze con degraded flight controls and braking, fornendo informazioni per scegliere la pista in base alla LDA e coordinare la schiumatura."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "degraded flight controls and brakingで故障の影響を説明し、管制官による着陸可能距離LDAを考慮した滑走路選択や泡散布の調整に情報を提供する表現です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "degraded flight controls and braking으로 고장의 운항상 영향을 설명하여 관제사가 착륙 가용 거리인 LDA를 고려한 활주로 선택과 포밍 조정을 할 수 있도록 하는 표현입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beschrijft de gevolgen met degraded flight controls and braking en geeft informatie voor baankeuze op basis van LDA en coördinatie van schuimbedekking."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Explica as consequências com degraded flight controls and braking, fornecendo informações para escolher a pista pela LDA e coordenar aplicação de espuma."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Описывает последствия словами degraded flight controls and braking, давая информацию для выбора ВПП с учётом LDA и координации нанесения пены."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用degraded flight controls and braking说明故障的运行影响，为管制员根据可用着陆距离LDA选择跑道及协调泡沫铺设提供信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
