    "Quantifying remaining fuel as '15 minutes of endurance' clarifies the urgency, ensuring immediate priority vectoring from air traffic control.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beziffert den Restkraftstoff mit 15 minutes of endurance, um die Dringlichkeit und den Bedarf an sofortiger vorrangiger Radarführung klarzumachen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuantifica el combustible como 15 minutes of endurance para aclarar la urgencia y comunicar la necesidad de vectores prioritarios inmediatos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quantifie le carburant restant par 15 minutes of endurance pour clarifier l’urgence et le besoin de guidage prioritaire immédiat."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quantifica il carburante con 15 minutes of endurance per chiarire l’urgenza e la necessità di vettori prioritari immediati."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "残燃料を15 minutes of enduranceと時間で表し、緊急性と優先誘導の必要性を明確に伝える表現です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "남은 연료를 15 minutes of endurance로 수량화하여 긴급성을 명확히 하고 관제사의 즉각적인 우선 유도 필요성을 전달하는 표현입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drukt de resterende brandstof uit als 15 minutes of endurance om de urgentie en de behoefte aan directe prioriteitsvectoren duidelijk te maken."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quantifica o combustível como 15 minutes of endurance para esclarecer a urgência e a necessidade de vetoração prioritária imediata."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Определяет остаток топлива как 15 minutes of endurance, уточняя срочность и необходимость немедленного приоритетного наведения."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用15 minutes of endurance量化剩余燃油，明确紧迫性并表达立即优先引导的需求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read a dialogue · choose a response · review mistakes": {
