    "Uses exact aerodynamic logic ('glide envelope') to rule out runway options, and uses the correct maritime term 'ditching' to trigger river-rescue deployment immediately.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erklärt mit glide envelope, warum die Piste nicht erreichbar ist, und bezeichnet mit ditching die Notwasserung und den Bedarf an Wasserrettung."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa glide envelope para explicar por qué se descartan las pistas y ditching para comunicar el amerizaje y la necesidad de rescate fluvial."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilise glide envelope pour expliquer l’impossibilité d’atteindre une piste, et ditching pour signaler l’amerrissage et le besoin de secours fluviaux."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa glide envelope per spiegare l’impossibilità di raggiungere le piste e ditching per comunicare l’ammaraggio e la necessità di soccorso fluviale."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "glide envelopeという空力上の概念で滑走路に到達できない理由を説明し、ditchingという用語で水上着陸と河川救助の必要性を伝えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "glide envelope라는 공기역학적 개념으로 활주로 도달이 어려운 이유를 설명하고, 수상 착륙을 뜻하는 ditching으로 하천 구조 대응의 필요성을 전달합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gebruikt glide envelope om uit te leggen waarom de baan onbereikbaar is en ditching om de noodlanding op water en benodigde waterredding aan te duiden."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa glide envelope para explicar por que as pistas estão fora de alcance e ditching para indicar amerissagem e necessidade de resgate fluvial."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Термин glide envelope объясняет недостижимость ВПП, а ditching обозначает приводнение и необходимость спасательной операции на воде."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以glide envelope这一气动概念说明无法到达跑道的原因，并用ditching表达水上迫降及水域救援需求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses sophisticated vocabulary ('wildlife ingestion', 'total loss of thrust') to explain the emergency, allowing ATC to coordinate airspace clearing across multiple local terminals.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beschreibt den Notfall mit wildlife ingestion und total loss of thrust, um die Koordination der Luftraumfreimachung zwischen Terminalbereichen zu unterstützen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa vocabulario como wildlife ingestion y total loss of thrust para explicar la emergencia y facilitar la coordinación del espacio aéreo entre terminales."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilise wildlife ingestion et total loss of thrust pour expliquer l’urgence et faciliter la coordination de l’espace aérien entre terminaux."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa termini come wildlife ingestion e total loss of thrust per spiegare l’emergenza e agevolare il coordinamento dello spazio aereo tra terminali."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "wildlife ingestionやtotal loss of thrustなどの語彙で緊急事態を説明し、複数の周辺管制圏での空域調整に情報を提供します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "wildlife ingestion과 total loss of thrust 같은 어휘로 비상상황을 설명하여 관제사가 인접 터미널 공역 정리를 조정할 수 있도록 하는 표현입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gebruikt wildlife ingestion en total loss of thrust om de noodsituatie te beschrijven en de coördinatie van het vrijmaken van terminalgebieden te ondersteunen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa termos como wildlife ingestion e total loss of thrust para explicar a emergência e ajudar na coordenação do espaço aéreo entre terminais."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Объясняет ситуацию терминами wildlife ingestion и total loss of thrust, помогая координировать освобождение воздушного пространства соседних районов."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用wildlife ingestion和total loss of thrust等词汇说明紧急情况，为管制员协调多个周边终端空域提供信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the standardized command 'Initiating immediate emergency descent' combined with target altitudes to instantly establish safe vertical clearing below the descending aircraft.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbindet Initiating immediate emergency descent mit Zielhöhen, um den Bedarf an vertikaler Staffelung unter dem sinkenden Flugzeug mitzuteilen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combina Initiating immediate emergency descent con las altitudes objetivo para comunicar la necesidad de separación vertical bajo la aeronave que desciende."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Associe Initiating immediate emergency descent aux altitudes visées pour signaler le besoin de séparation verticale sous l’appareil en descente."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combina Initiating immediate emergency descent con le quote obiettivo per comunicare la necessità di separazione verticale sotto l’aeromobile in discesa."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Initiating immediate emergency descentと目標高度を組み合わせ、降下中の航空機の下方空域での垂直間隔確保の必要性を伝えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Initiating immediate emergency descent와 목표 고도를 함께 사용하여 하강하는 항공기 아래 공역의 수직 분리 필요성을 전달하는 표현입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combineert Initiating immediate emergency descent met de doelhoogten om de behoefte aan verticale separatie onder het dalende vliegtuig aan te geven."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combina Initiating immediate emergency descent com altitudes alvo para comunicar a necessidade de separação vertical abaixo da aeronave em descida."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Сочетает Initiating immediate emergency descent с целевыми высотами, сообщая о необходимости вертикального эшелонирования под снижающимся самолётом."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将Initiating immediate emergency descent与目标高度结合，表达为下降航空器下方空域建立垂直间隔的需求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
